						<relatedFaction>Faction_10</relatedFaction>
						<arrivalTick>2477942</arrivalTick>
						<text>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Lynx&lt;/color&gt; received the title of Acolyte from &lt;color=#00BFFFFF&gt;The Exodus Empire&lt;/color&gt;!

Lynx has gained a new level of psylink! She can now use psychic powers of that higher level, but she needs to learn them first.

Upon gaining the new psylink level, Lynx automatically learned these psychic powers: Word of joy

If she dies, this title will be inherited by Nika Shelton. A new heir can be chosen by contacting The Exodus Empire through a comms console.

Permit points awarded: 1.

This title requires apparel appropriate to her title:
- Formal shirt, cape
- Ladies hat, beret
- Any prestige armor
- Any psycaster apparel

This title requires a throneroom that meets these requirements:
- Meditation throne
- Room area: 24 tiles
- All floored
- Brazier x2
- All braziers must be lit
- No work facilities allowed
- No beds allowed

This title requires a bedroom that meets these requirements:
- Room area: 16 tiles
- All floored
- Double bed
- No work facilities allowed</text>
