					<description>A 81-year-old low-wage worker named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Azami 'Panda' Berry&lt;/color&gt; is calling for help! He is hiding from a malfunctioning weather control satellite. He wants to flee and join you at &lt;color=#00BCD8FF&gt;Eden&lt;/color&gt;.

If he joins you, the weather will be rainy thunderstorm for &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;9.9 days&lt;/color&gt; until the satellite resets.

Desperate to stay hidden, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Panda&lt;/color&gt; claims to be unable to tell you more about himself.</description>
